// Phase 0A acceptance deck -- exercises every runtime test in one game.
//
//   Mountain            mana, land play
//   Ainok Tracker       morph -> alternative cost, face-down (P0A-E H4)
//   Faithless Looting   flashback -> graveyard action (P0A-K)
//   Goblin Instigator   token creation (P0A-F)
//   Shock               targeting, instant-speed response (P0A-C)
//
// DELIBERATELY NOT OPEN-FORMAT LEGAL. Copy counts exceed 4 so rare
// paths are reached deterministically rather than by lucky draw --
// PHASE_00A 0A.11A endorses stacked decks for architecture validation,
// and 0.62 says broad card coverage is not Phase 0's job. Deck-legality
// enforcement is Phase 2's, and is tested separately.
20 Mountain
14 Ainok Tracker
12 Faithless Looting
10 Goblin Instigator
8 Shock
